Package: token-me
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libayatana-appindicator3-1
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: desktop token usage and cost monitor
 TokenMe displays local AI tool usage, quota and cost in a desktop panel.
 Includes static collectors for remote x86-64 and ARM64 Linux machines.

Package: tokenme-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command line token usage collector
 Collect and export local AI tool usage without a desktop session.
